    "description": "== Poetry Update ==\r\n\r\nDaily updates new poetry in all categories and poets list\r\n\r\n== KEY FEATURES==\r\n\r\n\u2022 You can search any word to find your favorite poetry\r\n\u2022 Search engine\r\n\u2022 Unique poets and categories list\r\n\u2022 Easy to copying and sharing\r\n\u2022 Select any poetry and put in you favorite list\r\n\u2022 You can download offline poetry\r\n\u2022 List Swip left to share\r\n\u2022 List Swip right to whatsapp\r\n\u2022 Dark mode\r\n\u2022 Best Urdu Shayari in text\r\n\r\n\r\n== Add Your Poetry ==\r\n\r\n\u2022 You can send your poetry.\r\n\u2022 You can update your name and description.\r\n\u2022 You can edit your poetry that already published",
